keywords:
  - computational mathematics
  - cohomology
  - finite groups
  - Hurwitz spaces
  - certificates
abstract: >-
  Arbogast is a certificate-first computational mathematics library for finite exact
  cohomology, symmetry, and Hurwitz arithmetic. It separates discovery from verification
  and records mathematical results in provenance-preserving claim graphs.
